# ex14 — reductions fixture (mirrors demos/3-fold-scan/14-reductions.bqn)
n 8
col nord bool 1 0 1 1 0 1 0 0
col gold num 100 50 20 5 0 25 7 3
col hits bool 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 0
col resist num 0 0.25 0.5 0 0 0.75 0 0
col party bool 1 1 0 1 0 0 0 0
col alive bool 1 1 0 1 1 1 1 0
col forest bool 0 0 0 0 1 1 1 1
col burning bool 0 0 1 0 0 1 0 0
col twoHanded num 70 80 61 60 90 10 65 50
col none bool 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
# census addendum (ano-side only): merchant and the Whiterun membership mask, for the compound-scope and broadcast pins
col merchant bool 1 1 0 1 0 1 0 0
bind Whiterun mask 1 0 1 0 0 0 1 0
ja 北 Nord
ja 金 Gold
ja 抵抗 Resist
ja 命中 Hits
ja 生存 Alive
ja 一党 Party
ja 燃焼 Burning
ja 森 Forest
ja 無 None
ja 商人 Merchant
ja 両手 TwoHanded
ja ホワイトラン Whiterun
